# Testing ([PROJECT NAME])

Adjust globs and commands for your layout (`src/`, `lib/`, `games/`, etc.).

## Commands

| Command | Use when |
| --- | --- |
| `npm test` | Default — unit / logic |
| `npm run test:watch` | While iterating |
| [Add e2e command] | Page loads, browser behavior |

## When to add tests

- New pure function → unit test
- New page or critical path → smoke test
- Bug fixed → regression test

## Guards

- Husky + lint-staged on commit
- Dependabot weekly — review PRs
